c_2=  \left(\E\!\left[\lvert \gamma( W^0_1) \rvert^4\right]\right)^{1/4}
\end{align}
and
for every $N,m\in\N $  let $\epsUp_{N,m}\colon \{0,1,\ldots,N-1\}\to[0,\infty]$ satisfy for all $n\in \{0,1,\ldots,N-1\} $ that
\begin{align}\small\begin{split}
