\section{Online learning implementation}\label{section_online_learning_implementation}

This section introduces a cascaded online learning framework in order to implement the optimization-based control design presented in Section \ref{section_optimization_based_control}. This framework has been developed in References \cite{bib20,bib22}, but its performance suffers from insufficient action smoothness. To improve action smoothness, we introduce a hybrid approach that combines online temporal smoothness technique and a low-pass filter.  

