\subsubsection{Critic}

The critic network is updated through TD learning to minimize the quadratic TD error: 

\begin{equation}\label{Loss_critic_1}
    L^{C1}_{t} = \frac{1}{2}\delta_{1(t)}^{T}\delta_{1(t)}
\end{equation}

\begin{equation}
\begin{aligned}
    \delta_{1(t)} =& c_{1}(\hat{e}_{\alpha(t+1)},q_{t}) + \gamma \hat{V}_{1\text{target}}(\hat{\alpha}_{t+1},\hat{e}_{\alpha (t+1)})\\
    &-\hat{V}_{1}(\alpha_{t},e_{\alpha(t)}
\end{aligned}
\end{equation} 

\begin{equation}
    c_{1}(\hat{e}_{\alpha(t+1)},q_{t})= \hat{e}_{\alpha(t+1)}^{2} + a q_{t}^{2}
\end{equation}


\subsubsection{Actor}

The actor is updated to minimize the estimated state-value function:

\begin{equation}\label{optimal_pitch_rate_definition}
\begin{aligned}
    &v^{*}(\alpha_{t},e_{\alpha(t)},\delta_{t}) = \arg \min_{v_{t}}L^{A_{1}}_{t} \\
    L^{A_{1}}_{t} =& c_{1}(\hat{e}_{\alpha(t+1)},q_{t}) + \gamma \hat{V}_{1\text{target}}(\hat{\alpha}_{t+1},\hat{e}_{\alpha(t+1)})
\end{aligned}
\end{equation}

The gradient-descent-based updates of critic and actor are seen in Appendix \ref{appendix_B}.

