\textbf{The tokenization and attention mechanism of InfGen.}
\textbf{(A)} InfGen autoregressively generates a sequence of tokens representing a full traffic scenario.
Each simulation step consists of traffic light tokens (purple), agent state tokens (blue), and motion tokens (green), conditioned on static map tokens (red).
This structured tokenization enables step-wise rollout of the dynamic scene and allows new agents to be introduced at any timestep.
