To guarantee new condition~\ref{pro:map}(e) respecting subchains,
Definition~\ref{dfn:bri} will represent atoms $N_{i+1},A_{i+1},C_{i+1}$ in a basis of the  previous $i$-th residue.
The first residue needs only three invariants from Definition~\ref{dfn:trin} to determine the rigid shape of $\triangle N_1 A_1 C_1$ in $\R^3$. 
%\medskip
