Fig.~\ref{fig:hemoglobins}~(middle) illustrates the complexity of identifying similar proteins that can be given with very distant coordinates.
The similarity under rigid motion becomes clearer by comparing their diagrams and barcodes in Fig.~\ref{fig:hemoglobins}~(rows 2, 3).
