\figref{fig:UncertainCL} shows the feedback interconnection $\mathcal{F}_u(\mathcal{F}_l(G,K),\Delta)$ of an uncertain LTV system and the controller $K$, with $N:=\mathcal{F}_l(G,K)$ corresponding to~\eqref{eq:uLTV}.
