$\gamma_\text{IQC}^{(i)}$ of the uncertain closed loop $\mathcal{F}_u(\mathcal{F}_l(G,K),\Delta)$ is computed. Note that this step
uses the original uncertain plant without any scalings.  
A differential linear matrix inequality (DLMI) can be used to calculate an upper bound on
the worst-case gain.
