In Figure \ref{fig:lambda-evol}, we see the oscillation of the Lagrange multipliers simulated according to the dual-descent dynamics in Algorithm \ref{alg:dualdes}. We simulate multiple episodes which start from random initial starting points for the agents, with an initial value of $\lambda_0=5$. 
