\subsection{Asset Discovery}

So far, the architecture has been discussed from the perspective of blockchain network discovery. While it is a crucial step toward realizing the vision of an Internet of Blockchains, asset discovery holds equal significance to facilitate efficient interaction across blockchains. 
% For seamless interoperability between blockchains, it is essential to establish a mechanism that enables networks and smart contracts to locate providers of specific assets they seek to utilize. Such a mechanism facilitates efficient interaction across blockchains, ensuring that resources, tokens, or services can be identified and accessed without centralized intermediaries. 

% \begin{figure}[htbp]
%     \centering
