\sedit{For quantization, considering that more than 90 \% of the model weights in the baseline TTS models belong to 1D convolutional layers, we applied quantization to only 1D convolutional layers in baseline TTS models for simplicity. Quantized weights in convolutional layers were stored as int8, while other weights were stored as float32.}
