\ssedit{Comparing the modules to be quantized, the quantization of the vocoder results in lower MOS than that of the acoustic model. This could be because the vocoder, which generates the waveform, is more sensitive to quality degradation when quantized than the acoustic model. In addition, quantizing the acoustic model resulted in a greater reduction in the model size. This is because, in the TTS model used in this experiment, the majority of the model size is attributed to the acoustic model. Given these results, quantizing the acoustic model would be one of the best options in terms of the model size and the synthesis quality.}

