\kedit{
This paper investigates the QAT of TTS models for on-device use and proposes weight indexing to further reduce model size. The experimental results show that vocoder quantization significantly impacts the quality of TTS. We also confirmed that weight indexing greatly contributes to model size reduction. 
% In this experiment, weight indexing was applied only to \texttt{torch.nn.Conv1d}, but we believe it can also be applied to \texttt{torch.nn.Linear} and other layers, which we will explore in future work.
