\section{Comparison With State-of-the-Art Classification Methods}
\label{sec: sup comparison with state-of-the-art classification methods}
{
To further evaluate our proposed algorithm's performance against more advanced classification methods, we conduct additional experiments using Random Forest \cite{breiman2001random} and XGBoost \cite{chen2016xgboost}. These systems are chosen due to their widespread recognition as state-of-the-art methods for handling complex datasets effectively.

