      + \frac{48 c_2 L^3 (4\rho^2 N+\chi^2) (\sigma^2 + \delta^2)}{ \mu^4 (k+k_1-1)}  \nonumber \\
     & + \frac{(32+2c_1) L  (4\rho^2 N+\chi^2)  (\sigma^2 + \delta^2)}{ \mu^2 }.  \nonumber
\end{align}
This completes the proof.
\end{proof}
