\subsection{Research Questions}\label{sec:intro:RQs}

Since the authors' introduction to it, the AI-Lab framework has been implemented across multiple semesters. However, due to course enrollments and sample size constraints, strong empirical evidence of its impact on computer science education remained limited. Dickey et al. \cite{dickey2024innovating} provided experiences to gauge the validation of the framework, demonstrating its effectiveness. Additionally, Bejarano et al. \cite{Bejarano10114536415553705201} investigated shifts in students’ usage and perceptions of GenAI during the Spring 2024 semester in two Data Structures and Algorithms courses after running the AI-Lab. Although promising, the effect of the framework on Computer Science students required more insightful and rigorous analysis.

To this end, we propose two research questions to guide our work:
\begin{enumerate}
    \item[(RQ1)] How and how much are students using GenAI before and after the AI-Lab intervention?
    \item[(RQ2)] Are Students Open to Using GenAI in Their Learning Processes? If So, In What Scenarios?
\end{enumerate}


